ll take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80137\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80137 identified two issues:\r\n1. When a SpotLight3D's range is increased, its shadows get harder instead of remaining unchanged.\r\n2. When a SpotLight3D moves closer to the caster, its shadows get harder instead of softer.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes these issues, resulting in shadows that closely match the equivalent OmniLight3D.\r\n\r\nI note that I don't have a particularly deep understanding of the soft shadow rendering code. I used AI to answer questions about the code and suggest changes (which I then tested thoroughly and iterated on many times myself). I found the AI's explanations of exactly why this change needs to be this way unconvincing, so I'm not going to try to explain it in any more detail than is in the comments (which I mostly wrote myself). Any feedback/explanations from experts would be much appreciated. I did not use AI to write this description or to do any of the testing.\r\n\r\nThat said, I tested these changes across varying light size, light range, light angle, caster distance, receiver distance, and atlas size, and it closely matches OmniLight3D in all cases.\r\n\r\nBEFORE:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca3e0e17-1560-4b60-9a28-ab636b533856\r\n\r\nAFTER:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/114e7e8e-2124-49f8-b063-eb88ae11d089","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-30T13:59:24Z","updated_at":"2026-06-30T16:49:40Z","closed_at":"2026-06-30T14:44:26Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"493053a3c954ebc731eaf48033201b063d4e5d61","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"benbarsdell:fix-spotlight3d-soft-shadows","ref":"fix-spotlight3d-soft-shadows","repo":{"id":1285037167,"node_id":"R_kgDOTJgcbw","name":"godot","full_name":"benbarsdell/godot","owner":{"login":"benbarsdell","id":3979096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzkwOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3979096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell","html_url":"https://github.com/benbarsdell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benbarsdell/following{/ot